"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Guanghua Hospital - Joint Disease Specialist\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\"><img src=\"https://conversation.cdn.meoo.host/conversations/305931829356183552/image/2026-06-08/1780904580769-上海中医药大学附属光华医院.jpeg?auth_key=cf9eab76aa1bd2a530616b3d51902b6ba3575d6bc58b7dce4d0d032725154028\" alt=\"Guanghua Hospital exterior\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-950/85 via-green-950/70 to-teal-950/80\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">Guanghua Hospital Affiliated to Shanghai University of TCM</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\">Shanghai Guanghua Integrated Chinese-Western Medicine Hospital</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">Grade 3A specialized hospital featuring integrated Chinese-Western diagnosis &amp; treatment of joint diseases and rheumatic disorders</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">Founded in 1958</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">National Regional Joint Disease Center</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">City's Only 24h Gout Emergency</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-teal-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">Learn More</button><a class=\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Book Consultation</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Hospital Overview</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">1958</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Founded</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">600 beds</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Planned Beds</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">Grade 3A</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Hospital Grade</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">2 Campuses</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Xinhua &amp; Yan'an Rd</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">&gt;80%</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Joint Disease Beds</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-green-50 rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">Guanghua Hospital Affiliated to Shanghai University of TCM (Shanghai Guanghua Integrated Chinese-Western Medicine Hospital) was founded in 1958. It is a Grade 3A specialized hospital featuring integrated Chinese-Western diagnosis and treatment of joint diseases and rheumatic disorders. The hospital has two campuses at Xinhua Road and Yan'an West Road, with the new campus officially opened in May 2026, planning 600 beds.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">The hospital is the National Regional Joint Disease Diagnosis and Treatment Center, with over 80% of beds dedicated to joint disease specialties. Rheumatology &amp; Immunology and Orthopedics &amp; Traumatology are National TCM Advantage Specialties. The hospital holds proprietary preparations including snake-based formulations, Wenjing mixture, and Shujin mixture. Hip and knee replacement volumes rank among the top in Shanghai, while elbow and ankle replacement volumes rank among the top nationally. The hospital is transitioning from a specialized hospital to a comprehensive hospital and operates the city's only 24-hour gout emergency service.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Key Specialties</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Featuring integrated Chinese-Western medicine, forming significant disciplinary advantages in joint disease and rheumatic disorder diagnosis and treatment</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">National TCM Advantage Specialty</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Rheumatology &amp; Immunology</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Regional TCM Diagnosis &amp; Treatment Center for Rheumatic Diseases</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Expertise in rheumatoid arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis, osteoarthritis, gouty arthritis, SLE</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Advanced testing: anti-CCP antibody, HLA-B27, GPI antigen</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Early diagnosis accuracy at national leading level</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Proprietary TCM preparations including snake-based formulations</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">National TCM Advantage Specialty</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Orthopedics &amp; Traumatology</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Sub-specialties: joint surgery, spine surgery, hand &amp; foot trauma</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Systematic hip, knee, shoulder, elbow, ankle joint replacement &amp; revision</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>High reputation for joint replacement volume in Shanghai and nationwide</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Hip &amp; knee replacement volume ranks among top in Shanghai</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Elbow &amp; ankle replacement volume ranks among top nationally</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Complex surgeries: cervical RA anterior/posterior approach, AS kyphosis correction</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">Key Construction Specialty of NTCM</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Joint Medicine</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Shanghai TCM Featured Specialty &amp; Key Discipline</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Focus on pharmacological &amp; integrated treatment for RA, AS and other rheumatic diseases</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Rich experience in early diagnosis and integrated Chinese-Western collaborative treatment</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">Shanghai TCM Advantage Specialty</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Rehabilitation</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">National \"Flagship\" Department for Chinese-Western Collaboration</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Featured integrated TCM diagnosis &amp; treatment for neck, shoulder, waist &amp; leg pain</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Comprehensive use of needle-knife, silver needle, warm acupuncture, tuina, chiropractic</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Combined with modern techniques: ozone, radiofrequency, needle-knife endoscopy</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Significant efficacy in spinal joint diseases and periarticular soft tissue pain</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">City's Only</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Gout Department</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">The city's only 24-hour gout emergency service</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Focus on integrated treatment for acute &amp; chronic gouty arthritis</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>24/7 emergency medical services</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">Integrated Chinese-Western Feature</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">Oncology</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Three directions: medical oncology, interventional oncology, integrated treatment</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>From early cancer diagnosis to chemotherapy, immunotherapy, targeted therapy, TCM &amp; integrated treatment</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Comprehensive diagnostic &amp; therapeutic services</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Expert Team</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">Core Experts by Department</h3><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">Rheumatology &amp; Immunology</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 mb-2\">He Dongyi</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Discipline Leader</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Yang Xiaoling</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Chief Physician</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Graduated from Shanghai University of TCM in 1993, Director of Gout Dept since 2005\nStudied under renowned rheumatologist Ni Liqing\nExpert in integrated treatment of gout, AS, osteoporosis, SLE</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">Joint Surgery</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Ouyang Guilin</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Director of Joint Surgery, Chief Physician, PhD, Master Supervisor</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Expert in artificial knee, hip, elbow, ankle, shoulder joint replacement &amp; revision\nRich experience in surgical treatment of RA, AS, osteoarthritis</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">He Yong</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Director of Joint Orthopedic Surgery, Chief Physician, MD, Master Supervisor</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Experienced in shoulder, knee, hip, elbow joint disease treatment\nExpert in arthroscopic minimally invasive surgery &amp; joint replacement\nNominated for Shanghai \"Silver Snake Award\" &amp; \"Youth May 4th Medal\"</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Gao Huali</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Associate Chief Physician</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Expert in arthroscopic surgery &amp; robot-assisted joint replacement</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Han Dapeng</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Associate Chief Physician</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Expert in artificial joint replacement &amp; arthroscopic surgery</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Xu Yuelin</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Chief Physician</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Pioneer in domestic knee &amp; hip artificial joint replacement</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">Spine Surgery</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 mb-2\">Huang Zheng</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Director of Spine Surgery, Chief Physician, Orthopedic PhD, Master Supervisor</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Huang Zheng</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Director of Spine Surgery</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Expert in integrated &amp; minimally invasive treatment of lumbar disc herniation, spinal stenosis, cervical spondylosis, AS, RA</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Zhang Zifeng</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Director of Spinal Trauma Surgery, Associate Chief Physician, MD</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Expert in minimally invasive treatment of spinal diseases &amp; complex cervical spondylosis surgery</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Xiao Lianbo</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">Chief Orthopedic Physician</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Conducts artificial joint replacement &amp; inte